# Repository allow-list: keep the working tree focused on source and durable project data.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!AGENTS.md

# Active source tree.
!source/
!source/**

# Pinned STS2 0.107.1 game snapshot used by CI and local compatibility checks.
# Intentionally retained and stored through Git LFS; do not treat as generated output.
!game-body/
!game-body/**
/game-body/**/*.log

# GitHub configuration.
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/**

# Local/generated outputs must stay outside Git.
/.local/
/artifacts/
/runtime-evidence/
/source/coverage/
/source/.godot/
/source/tools/**/bin/
/source/tools/**/obj/
/source/tools/**/results*.json
/source/docs/**/evidence/
/source/docs/**/*.zip
/source/docs/performance/**/*.json
/source/docs/performance/**/*.patch
/source/docs/strategy/**/*.json
/source/docs/strategy/**/*.patch
/source/docs/testing/generated-*.json
